  "name": "Sun Cleric: Burning Heat swaps only the highest Sunflare rank into Sun Ray (#13674)",
  "contract": [
    "Report #13674: when Burning Heat 704908 procs and the Sun Cleric casts the instant Sun Ray 504764, Sunflare",
    "can drop off the action bar and become uncastable. Sunflare ranks (800231 and 502386..502397) are mana spells,",
    "so SpellInfo::IsStackableWithRanks keeps every learned rank active. AscensionSunCleric::Refresh previously",
    "mapped every known Sunflare rank to 504764, so on proc Player::SetTemporarySpellReplacement saw sharedReplacement",
    "and sent SMSG_REMOVED_SPELL(504764) plus one SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL per rank, and on revert saw previousShared and",
    "sent SMSG_LEARNED_SPELL for every rank except the arbitrary last rank in m_spells hash order. Expected with",
    "ranks 1..11 known (top rank 502395 on button 0): gaining 803238 replaces only 502395 with 504764 (one supersede",
    "for 504764, no lower rank replaced, no learned alert); casting it consumes 803238, grants Scorch Marks 807059,",
    "and restores 502395 with a single supersede for 502395 and zero supersedes for lower ranks; repeating while",
    "Scorch Marks is active behaves the same; ending Scorch Marks unlearns 504764 while 502395 stays on button 0 and",
    "casts cleanly."
  ],
